      IsNet0 5 q (5 * 1) (digPoint q (5 * 1) (graphGenK (m := 5 * 1) (fun _ => 1) Φ)) := by
  sorry

/-- **`prop:k1designs`(2), `s = 6`, `K₁ = 3`**: for every `q` with no prime factor in
